Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Who Are You?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 39
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who…who is calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Xiao Lü?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You figured it out? I’m—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Lü, how did you turn into jelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that monster? We need to get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your realm of consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.87,0:00:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am going to take control of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re controlling my body? What exactly do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want you to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it’s quite nice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have whatever you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re so eager to know, I’ll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In my own world, I was incredibly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a gentle breeze could blow me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to rely on my innate parasitic ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,living as a parasite inside stones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,or inside trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,living every day in constant fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, someone reached out to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,offering to help me gain a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed that person to another cosmos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and saw a world unlike any other
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Encouraged by him, I tried inhabiting other people’s bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally experienced the joy of having a body
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What a truly real existence it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But because ordinary human bodies were incompatible with me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I would soon feel the body rejecting me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I had to find a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,During that time, I kept searching for a suitable body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Until…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I inhabited your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body turned out to be a perfect match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also discovered…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that I could unleash my full potential in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I regain control of my own body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you show a little politeness when I’m speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s an exit. I didn’t expect it to be so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get out of here, I can reclaim my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You want out? Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day on, this body is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I get locked up without even realizing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there? Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the adorable Paddi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting; I’ve already seen through your disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I {\i1}am{\i0} Paddi! Why are you locking me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop pretending to be Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re that monster from the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Found out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m curious—how did you discover me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When we mentioned catching the monster, you were suddenly in such a rush to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew right then that you were suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly hid it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you still gave yourself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you were attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,did you see anything else strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I saw a monster…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a blob of green jelly flying towards me…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a green handkerchief flying through the air…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the culprit…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,must look something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If my deductions are correct…This is your true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who looks that ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the one who kept possessing the residents and draining their energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could such a strange creature exist in our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the monster that attacked us a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They both came from that mysterious rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect to find someone so clever here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as you said, I am parasitizing Paddi’s body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But what can you do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a way to make him come out willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you wouldn’t have the heart to harm innocent Paddi’s body?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop—hurry, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That really is a good method.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Are you coming out or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give my body back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just accept it and give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m taking my body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I’m here, there’s no way you’re getting your body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you can do, I can do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this—my pillow attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Who doesn’t know that move?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out my ultimate finishing move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s awake—it’s Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s that familar Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t it be better to just hand the body over to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know what I’m capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you just watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s such a mess; maybe we should…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to help; I’ll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to my explanation—actually, it’s like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, the fragment must not fall into the hands of the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I had no choice but to use you to enter the trial zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll think of another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I don’t jeopardize your dream of becoming a flower because of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fake, also fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be fake, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s the one who impersonated a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined your imagination was so vivid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, when will he wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s fighting right now; whether he wakes up depends on his willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve finally recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually won.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, will you? I really am Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve already taken care of it in my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I have a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We can let you go, but you have to pass our test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you eat this bowl of noodles, we’ll believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This bowl of noodles was made by our old friend, the restaurant owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This test is too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That way of eating—there’s no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he’s the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he’s a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What’s the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go around wrongly accusing a good goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The evidence is right here in these scallions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner, do you remember your testimony back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember one of them looked ugly when he ate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other disliked scallions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can pretend to be ugly when you eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but being a picky eater is instinctive—it’s impossible to fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Paddi been defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That’ll teach you to try controlling my body again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what it’s like to be without a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to enjoy delicious food or feel the warmth of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But…but you still can’t just…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,take control of someone else’s body without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to feel the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to enjoy the food, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I have one last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To hug a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the only wish I have left—can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as a trick if you like; this is my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, but I need Paddi’s body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, don’t force me to hurt you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How would we know without fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you my true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s not enough to make me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s held me up for so long; I need to get back quickly.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
